      "body": "The deploy widget on the MiniMax-H3 cookbook page renders a \"Learn more\" link per serve dimension. Five of the six dimensions point it at a section anchor that does not exist on the page:\n\n```\nlearnMore: \"#7-feature-contracts-and-advanced-recipes\",\n```\n\nOn `docs/cookbook/diffusion/MiniMax/MiniMax-H3.mdx`, section 7 is **VDN-H3: hybrid attention, 8-step distill**; \"Feature contracts and advanced recipes\" is section **9**. So the link lands nowhere.\n\nThis changes all five occurrences in `docs/src/snippets/configs/MiniMaxAI/minimax-h3.jsx` to `#9-feature-contracts-and-advanced-recipes`. The sixth entry in the same file already uses a valid anchor (`#choose-the-quality-level`) and is untouched.\n\nDocs-only.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #41648593132](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41648593132)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41648593530](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41648593530)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
